Short:        What it does, in one line (40 max)
Uploader:     you@example.com (Your Name)
Author:       you@example.com (Your Name)
Type:         util/misc
Version:      @VERSION@
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0
Distribution: Aminet
Requires:     AmigaOS 3.0 or newer. 68000.
Kurz:         Dasselbe auf Deutsch (40 Zeichen)

MyApp @VERSION@  --  @DATE@


; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; This is the Aminet .readme template. tools/make_aminet_readme.py renders it
; into dist/aminet/<project>.readme, substituting only @VERSION@ and @DATE@
; (read from src/<project>_rev.h, so the readme cannot claim a version the
; binaries do not have), and then validates the result against Aminet's rules.
;
; Edit the prose here, never the generated file. Delete these comment lines --
; Aminet has no comment syntax, and the header must be followed by the body.
;
; The rules the generator enforces, so you know what it will reject:
;   * Short:, Uploader:, Type: and Architecture: are mandatory.
;   * Short:/Kurz: are at most 40 characters; they go in the index and say
;     what the program DOES -- not its version and not its platform, which
;     have fields of their own.
;   * Type: must be an Aminet top-level directory plus a subdirectory.
;   * Distribution: is exactly "Aminet" or "NoCD".
;   * Lines are at most 78 characters, ASCII, ending in a bare linefeed.
;   * The header ends at the FIRST BLANK LINE; a field below that is body text
;     as far as Aminet is concerned and will not be seen.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


WHAT IT IS

A sentence or two on what the program is, for a reader who has only seen
the one-line Short: in the index.


WHAT IT DOES

  * The features, as a short list
  * Each one a line, in the order a user meets them


WHAT IT NEEDS

The OS version, the CPU, and anything that must already be installed.
Be specific about what happens on a machine that has less.


INSTALLING

Unpack, open the drawer and double-click Install.


LICENCE

Say whether it may be redistributed, including on Aminet CDs and
coverdisks, and name the licence of anything bundled that has one of its
own.


THANKS

To whoever earned it.
